# {{ distribution }}

Typed Python client of the twin **{{ twin_name }}** (`{{ twin_id }}`). It reads the
twin through its HTTP API: every object and link type of the twin's ontology has an
accessor that returns the type's Pydantic model, and every question of the twin is
a method.

